%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: IsActorInCombatWithPlayer(NPC)
goto: PlayerCombatBranch

cond: IsActorInCombat(NPC)
goto: CombatBranch

cond: true
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: PlayerCombatBranch
npc: Alright, speak up. Why the hell are you attacking me?
#
o_text: I'm sorry, I didn't mean to attack you.
o_goto: Apology
#
o_text: Because I can.
o_goto: BecauseICan

name: Apology
npc: Fine, just don't do it again.
effect: EndHostility
effect: EndConversation

name: BecauseICan
npc: You're a real piece of work, you know that?
effect: EndConversation

name: CombatBranch
npc: I'm kind of busy right now.
effect: EndConversation

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Where to, stranger?
#
o_text: Just drive.
o_goto: Drive
#
o_text: Take me home.
o_id: go_home
o_cond: !IsMap('zone_residential_south')
o_goto: DriveHome
#
o_text: Get me to the eastern rim district (Cognetic Bastards & La Boom).
o_id: go_eastern_rim
o_cond: !IsMap('zone_commerce')
o_goto: EasternRim
#
o_text: Drop me off in the eastern residential district.
o_id: go_residential_east
o_cond: !IsMap('zone_residential_east')
o_goto: ResidentialEast
#
o_text: Take me to the western residential district.
o_id: go_residential_west
o_cond: !IsMap('zone_residential_west')
o_goto: ResidentialWest
#
o_text: Get me to the Terra Vitae headquarters.
o_id: go_terra_vitae
o_cond: !IsMap('hq_terra_vitae')
o_goto: TerraVitae
#
o_text: Take me to the mansion outside the wall.
o_id: go_mansion
o_cond: HasFlag('LocationKnown(mansion)') && !IsMap('mansion')
o_goto: Mansion
#
o_text: Ever drive anyone to a mansion outside the wall?
o_id: ask_mansion
o_cond: !HasFlag('LocationKnown(mansion)')
o_goto: AskMansion
#
o_text: Nevermind.
o_goto: Bye

name: Bye
npc: Alright, see you around.
effect: EndConversation

name: Drive
npc: Sure thing.
#
o_text: (Wait)
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: DriveHome
npc: Home sweet home.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'zone_residential_south', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(15)
effect: EndWithChatter

name: EasternRim
npc: You got it.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'zone_commerce', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(15)
effect: EndWithChatter

name: ResidentialEast
npc: Sure, the east side it is.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'zone_residential_east', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(15)
effect: EndWithChatter

name: ResidentialWest
npc: The west side, no problem.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'zone_residential_west', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(15)
effect: EndWithChatter

name: TerraVitae
npc: Terra Vitae. Fancy place, that.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'hq_terra_vitae', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(20)
effect: EndWithChatter

name: AskMansion
npc: (He eyes you in the mirror.) Maybe. Drove a whole catering crew out there last month.
+ Rich folks don't like their address getting around, you know.
#
o_text: Come on. I'm good for it, and so are you.
o_id: mansion_persuade
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Easy')
o_succ: MansionTold
o_fail: MansionClamUp
#
o_text: Two hundred sat says you remember the way.
o_id: mansion_pay
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 200)
o_goto: MansionPaid
#
o_text: Forget it.
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: MansionPaid
npc: (He pockets the money.) Memory's coming back already.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 200)
#
o_text: So?
o_goto: MansionTold

name: MansionTold
npc: South gate, then the old highway, half an hour out. Big place behind a wall of its own.
+ I can take you, if you're paying the fare.
effect: SetFlag('LocationKnown(mansion)')
#
o_text: Take me there now.
o_id: mansion_now
o_goto: Mansion
#
o_text: Later.
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: MansionClamUp
npc: Nah. Some things you keep to yourself in this business. No offense.
#
o_text: None taken.
o_goto: DefaultIntroduction

name: Mansion
npc: Out past the wall it is. Hold on.
effect: TransitionWithDriver(NPC, 'mansion', 'taxi_stand')
effect: AdvanceTimeByMinutes(30)
effect: EndWithChatter
